# StockEasy — root-level ignores
#
# Per-subproject .gitignore files live in backend/, backend/Inventory/, frontend/.
# This file scopes ignores that are project-wide (not specific to a stack).
#
# IMPORTANT: docs/dist/*.pdf are COMMITTED (per CONTEXT.md D-17 / DOC-08) — the
# evaluator opens them straight from the repo. Do NOT add `docs/dist/` or
# `*.pdf` here.

# docs: mermaid-filter intermediate artifacts (do NOT ignore docs/dist/*.pdf — those are committed)
docs/.mermaid-filter*
docs/dist/*.tmp
docs/dist/*.html

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
